00:00:28,890 --> 00:00:33,350
Compare past and present to expand answers for IELTS Speaking part 1.

6
00:00:33,650 --> 00:00:37,290
First of all, let's review what we've learned in the previous lesson.

7
00:00:37,870 --> 00:00:42,550
