a waste of money, but nowadays I'm very into it.

42
00:02:59,830 --> 00:03:03,470
Two years ago, I took a summer camp trip to China, which

43
00:03:03,470 --> 00:03:07,750
opened my eyes and made me realize the values that traveling can

44
00:03:07,750 --> 00:03:12,070
offer me, such as personal growth, new knowledge, and meaningful connections.

45
00:03:12,910 --> 00:03:17,090
From the example above, we can see that the comparison between the

46
00:03:17,090 --> 00:03:21,770
