47
00:03:21,770 --> 00:03:25,550
contrasting phrases in the past and nowadays.

48
00:03:26,470 --> 00:03:31,050
In addition to these phrases, I'll introduce some other expressions and phrases

49
00:03:31,050 --> 00:03:33,170
