So, what types of questions can this technique be applied to?

52
00:03:53,300 --> 00:03:57,400
The technique Compare Past and Present can be used with various types

53
00:03:57,400 --> 00:04:04,120
of questions, as long as they are about a specific object, phenomenon, trend, or habit.

54
00:04:04,790 --> 00:04:08,120
Therefore, it can be applied to the following question types.

55
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:10,240
Liking and disliking questions.

56
00:04:10,760 --> 00:04:12,740
For example, do you like eating out?

57
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:14,700
Basic description questions.

58
00:04:15,300 --> 00:04:17,600
For example, tell me about your hometown.

59
00:04:18,620 --> 00:04:19,420
Frequency questions.

60
00:04:20,100 --> 00:04:22,580
For example, how often do you read books?

61
00:04:23,180 --> 00:04:24,100
And trend questions.

62
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:27,860
For example, what kind of restaurants are popular in your country?

63
00:04:29,020 --> 00:04:29,440
Great!

